# Keen32 -warp 1 -script: Keen walks, jumps and throws in the first level (the same run at 32 and 64 bit)
wait 150
shot w1.png
down right
wait 140
up right
press ctrl
wait 60
shot w2.png
down right
wait 100
press alt
wait 60
up right
shot w3.png
down left
wait 120
up left
press ctrl
wait 80
shot w4.png
quit
